# Defra accessibility

- WCAG 2.2 AA is mandatory for all Defra services, including internal tools and Power BI reports.
- Defra accessibility guidance: <https://digital.defra.gov.uk/accessibility> and <https://defra-design.github.io/accessibility/>
- Third-party products such as Power BI must comply with the Technology Code of Practice. Known Power BI gaps go in the report's accessibility statement.
- Defra Accessibility Team, for guidance or an audit: **accessibility@defra.gov.uk**
